WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.250
Drug addiction is a social evil that every family fears.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.750
Getting addicted while still a student is even more frightening, with a whole future ahead.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.450
A worrying figure: 60% of first-time drug users are aged 15 to 25,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.850
and students are a group that synthetic-drug dealers are targeting.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.950
Children start early, but parents find out late.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.850
Sadly, some high-school students have had to go to rehab

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.850
after using drugs for two or three years.
